# Command-line arguments for the prometheus-tplink-plug-exporter server.
#
# These arguments are passed directly to the exporter process.
# Note on escaping:
# - In shell contexts, backslashes for regexes need to be doubled (e.g., \\\\d for \d).
# - If running under systemd, shell escaping may require further doubling
#   (e.g., \\\\\\\\d for \d), and newlines must also be escaped.
# The variable 'args' should contain the full string of arguments to pass.
ARGS="{{ args | default('') }}"
